  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Mixed material upper offers a premium look and feel with fast-paced styleUnique lacing system with nylon eye stays for a secure fitWavy lines and classic Air Max 95 visuals for OG styleReflective material at the heel for low-light visibilityAir-Sole midsole for cushioned comfortVisible Air in the heel and forefootWaffle and flex grooves on the outsole enhance durability and tractionThe Nike Air Max 95 is imported.Add natural flow to any outfit in the legendary Women's Nike Air Max 95 Casual Shoes. A standout design in the Air Max family, the Air Max 95 combines functionality and fashion by incorporating the plush Air cushioning into a track-inspired design boasting a blend of premium materials and the distinctively sleek and wavy design lines that are often imitated, but never duplicated.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's Nike Air Max 95 Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>British Khaki/Linen/Sanddrift/Phantom</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3495799</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\